Package: SyncER
Title: Synchronicity testing for Event Records
Version: 0
Authors@R: person("Katleen", "Wils", email = "katleen.wils@ugent.be",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: SyncER allows for evaluation of synchronous deposition across different event records using a log-ratio approach. Additionally, it allows syncing age-depth models based on the availability of isochrons.
License: GPL (>= 3)
